          "insert": "How Knowledge Returns to the Loop"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "h-knowledge": {
      "id": "h-knowledge",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Sync imports source material under each game's refresh policy. Completed workers supply attempt evidence through the enabled summarizer. Librarians propose cited facts and relationships through the validated apply layer; later workers read target cards and query the updated knowledge. Optional curation can remain pending without being reported as complete."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
